                "retweet_count": 3786,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In addition to kicking millions of Americans off their health insurance, cutting taxes for the wealthy, and adding trillions to the deficit, other parts of Trump\u2019s Budget are also harmful and unpopular. \n\nWe need to make sure more people learn about them.\n\nRead more here: https://t.co/0hZzARbwes",
