                "reply_count": 2535,
                "retweet_count": 4846,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "If there was ever a time to call your Senator, this is it.\u00a0\n\nVoting has begun on the GOP plan to cut off health care for working-class Americans and slash taxes for the wealthiest. This bill would kick millions off their health insurance, and thousands will even lose their lives - unless we stop it in its tracks. \n\nSome Republicans are breaking ranks, showing it's not too late. Time to speak up!",
