                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 322,
                "retweet_count": 696,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Hearing statistics about Trump\u2019s budget doesn\u2019t tell the full story. This isn\u2019t just about numbers on a page - it\u2019s about the real lives that feel the consequences of it.\n\nI\u2019m grateful to Dr. Jill, a health care provider in rural Wisconsin, for taking the time to talk with me and share what she\u2019s already seeing in her community. \n\nYou can watch our full conversation over on my Substack: https://t.co/97DKbFYcdN",
