                "retweet_count": 1005,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Much attention has rightly been paid to the sheer strangeness of RFK Jr.\n\nBut as the person now in charge of our public health, what really matters - more than the theatrics or trolling - is what he is taking away from us.\n\nRead more here: https://t.co/YImnkJSuzn",
