                "reply_count": 8752,
                "retweet_count": 3024,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In the coming days, millions of Americans will be notified that their health insurance will cost thousands of dollars more next year.\n\nMeanwhile, President Trump is busy tearing down the East Wing of the White House to build a gilded ballroom for exclusive dinner parties.\n\nIt doesn't have to be like this.",
