                "reply_count": 4054,
                "retweet_count": 1929,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "We can\u2019t let this happen. \n\nAnd any Republican who refuses to renew health care subsidies for hardworking American families, saying we can\u2019t afford it, needs to explain how they found $1 trillion in tax cuts to give away to the wealthiest people in America. https://t.co/3Rvbpi1r2W",
