                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "New Jersey, you deserve a governor who stands up for you: lowering grocery prices, tackling health care costs, and confronting Trump\u2019s attempt to \u201cterminate\u201d the biggest infrastructure project in America, which happens to be in your state.\n\nThere\u2019s only one candidate ready to do that, and her name is @MikieSherrill.\n\nThanks for the energetic welcome today - let\u2019s turn that momentum into victory on Tuesday!",
